cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this workflow, its data or its models, please cite this
  repository and the accompanying publication. Also cite the original
  studies for the observed concentration data listed in 00_Data.
title: "PBPK mAb NAM Tutorial"
abstract: >-
  End-to-end tutorial for a priori physiologically based pharmacokinetic
  (PBPK) prediction of monoclonal antibody pharmacokinetics in monkey and
  human with PK-Sim/MoBi and R, evaluated retrospectively on eight IV mAbs,
  plus a simulation-based reanalysis of reduced monkey PK study designs.
type: software
authors:
  - name: "NAMLink (namlink-org) contributors"
repository-code: "https://github.com/namlink-org/PBPK_mAb_NAM_Tutorial"
url: "https://namlink.org"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - PBPK
  - monoclonal antibodies
  - pharmacokinetics
  - new approach methodologies
  - PK-Sim
  - MoBi
  - ospsuite
  - target-mediated drug disposition
  - study design
  - 3Rs
